#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-middleware.md:9
msgid "ST USB 中间件接入"
msgstr "ST USB middleware integration"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-middleware.md:11
msgid "协议栈不得另建控制器owner；先阅读[USB生命周期](usb-lifecycle.md)和所选Device／Host合同。"
msgstr ""
"Protocol stacks must not create another controller owner. Read the [USB "
"lifecycle](usb-lifecycle.md) and the selected Device/Host contracts first."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-middleware.md:13
msgid "按需官方 Core middleware"
msgstr "Optional official Core middleware"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-middleware.md:15
msgid ""
"`st-usb-device` 与 `st-usb-host` 只准备精确锁定的相应 middleware Core。 "
"`components/protocols/st_usb_device` 和 `components/protocols/st_usb` 使用调用者静态"
" state、slots、 staging、有限 deadline 和显式 Thread step。官方 Handle／class／descriptor"
" 回调表 留在私有接线边界，公共 I/O 不泄漏厂商类型；不选时不编译、不建立堆或后台任务。"
msgstr ""
"`st-usb-device` and `st-usb-host` prepare only their precisely pinned "
"middleware Cores. `components/protocols/st_usb_device` and "
"`components/protocols/st_usb` use caller-supplied static state, slots and "
"staging, finite deadlines and explicit Thread steps. Official "
"Handle/class/descriptor callback tables remain at the private wiring "
"boundary; public I/O exposes no vendor types. Unselected components are not "
"compiled and create neither a heap nor background tasks."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-middleware.md:20
msgid ""
"Device Core 复用现有 epoch、activation 和真实 packet settlement。多包 DATA IN 在同 epoch "
"提前接纳零长 STATUS OUT；线上 STATUS 已结束但 DMA 内存尚未 join 时， bridge 根据权威 "
"`control_pending=false` 暂停 EP0 Core 续包派发，先会合双方向。 只转交真实已结清的 IN ACK 和 "
"STATUS，不补造 `EP0_TxSent`，不因这段合法间隔 锁存 INVALID，也不重放下一 IN payload。新 "
"SETUP、deadline 与停止仍须完整排空。 Host Core 在断开后先排空，再允许 Core reset／class 退出及显式 cold "
"restart。 两者均锁存官方 Core 忽略的 LL 错误。Host 可提供每 pipe 12 字节 caller 存储， 在 OpenPipe "
"后显式绑定 descriptor interval；同一次 open 内不可重复绑定来重置 机会。桥接从真实 14-bit SOF "
"观察推进有界剩余间隔，要求在完整 counter wrap 前 调用 `step`。过早请求报告 NOTREADY／零长度且不借用缓冲，防止忽略 LL "
"BUSY 的 官方调用者误读旧 DONE。所有 endpoint 最坏碰撞预算限制为 FS／LS 900 µs、 HS 100 µs，每个 URB "
"至多一个 MPS；无自动派发、相位打包、hub split 或实时保证。 完整 URB 共用一个绝对 deadline，不在分包时续期。Device "
"不因此取得 ISO 周期 调度。Device Core 的 feature 意图不能替代实际 STATUS ACK，远程唤醒仍服从上述协议许可与 "
"service 合同。"
msgstr ""
"Device Core reuses existing epochs, activation and actual packet settlement."
" Multi-packet DATA IN can admit early zero-length STATUS OUT within the same"
" epoch. When wire STATUS has finished but DMA memory has not joined, the "
"bridge uses authoritative `control_pending=false` to pause further EP0 Core "
"dispatch and first join both directions. It forwards only genuinely settled "
"IN ACK and STATUS, inventing no `EP0_TxSent`, latching no INVALID for this "
"legal interval, and replaying no next IN payload. New SETUP, deadline and "
"stop still require complete drain. Host Core drains on disconnect before "
"permitting Core reset/class exit and explicit cold restart. Both latch LL "
"errors ignored by official Core. Host can supply 12 bytes of caller storage "
"per pipe and explicitly bind descriptor intervals after OpenPipe; repeated "
"binding within the same open is rejected, preventing opportunities from "
"being reset. The bridge advances bounded remaining intervals from actual "
"14-bit SOF observations and requires `step` before a complete counter wrap. "
"Early requests report NOTREADY/zero length without borrowing buffers, "
"preventing official callers that ignore LL BUSY from reading stale DONE. "
"Worst-collision budgets across all endpoints are limited to FS/LS 900 µs or "
"HS 100 µs, with at most one MPS per URB. There is no automatic dispatch, "
"phase packing, hub split or real-time guarantee. A complete URB shares one "
"absolute deadline, never renewed per packet. Device gains no ISO periodic "
"scheduler. Device Core feature intent cannot replace actual STATUS ACK; "
"remote wakeup still follows the protocol-permission and service contracts "
"above."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-middleware.md:36
msgid ""
"私有 Device Core bridge 把 profile ISO 显式映射到 `USBD_EP_TYPE_ISOC`，不把 Nexus "
"枚举值当作官方 wire 类型。Core／class 仍由特权 Thread 显式 step，packet 失败沿既有收条传播，不增加自动 class "
"恢复或完整音视频协议栈。"
msgstr ""
"The private Device Core bridge explicitly maps profile ISO to "
"`USBD_EP_TYPE_ISOC` rather than treating a Nexus enum value as the official "
"wire type. Core/class still runs through an explicit privileged-Thread step."
" Packet failures propagate through existing receipts without adding "
"automatic class recovery or a complete audio/video protocol stack."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-middleware.md:40
msgid ""
"选入 HCD 的 `HAL_Delay` 与官方 Host Core 的 `USBH_Delay` 使用既有 Core timer， 不安装 "
"SysTick。除了实际 deadline， 它对计数冻结保留有限无进展预算；invalid、后退或持续冻结时进入不返回的 park， 不把 void "
"delay 早退当作成功。原 cold receipt 和所有借用仍保留，故障／reset 策略 由外部 owner 负责。System STOP "
"前必须完成所有 delay、request 和角色事务的撤回。"
msgstr ""
"Selected HCD `HAL_Delay` and official Host Core `USBH_Delay` use the "
"existing Core timer without installing SysTick. In addition to checking the "
"actual deadline, the delay retains a finite no-progress budget for a frozen "
"counter. Invalid, backward or persistently frozen timing enters a non-"
"returning park; an early return from a void delay is not treated as success."
" The original cold receipt and all loans remain retained; fault/reset policy"
" belongs to the external owner. All delay, request and role transactions "
"must be withdrawn before System STOP."
